abstract: >-
  Classical Python toy simulation of OES-32-style metrics. No qubits and no
  quantum error-correcting code. Every printed value is SYNTHETIC: output of
  hand-written formulas on generated inputs (the ~95% success rate is a
  hard-coded floor, not a measured error-correction rate). Not a benchmark;
  not hardware, medical, or production software.
